&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Disclosure: I'm the founder of Jobspiq, which is one of the tools below. Every other product is described from its own public pages as read in October 2026. I didn't test other services' alert speed and make no claim about it. The full comparison, with a link to every source, is on &lt;a href="https://jobspiq.in/blog/job-alert-apps-for-developers-india-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;jobspiq.in&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quick answer:&lt;/strong&gt; use one large portal for reach (LinkedIn or Naukri) and one fast alert service for the companies you care about. Which fast service suits you depends on where it looks for jobs and how it reaches you: email, app push or Telegram.&lt;/p&gt;

